-- **The manifest for the first Gabbro program that PRINTS -- and it prints out of a build.**
--
-- `B1`'s acceptance criterion is a CHANGE and not a number: *a `.gab` file plus a manifest,
-- `gabbro build`, and the binary runs -- with NO hand-written C.* This is that file.
--
-- One unit, one source, no library below it. The `putchar` it calls is libc's, and libc is
-- linked by `cc` without anything in this manifest saying so -- **that is the hosted case,
-- and it is the whole difference to `beispiele/07` and the bare-metal half of the corpus.**
compiler cc -std=c11 -O0 -Wall -Wextra -Werror
out      target/bau-hallo

unit hallo program
    beispiele/63-druckt.gab
